New feeds display on jbotcan.org might be of interest to some of you:

http://jbotcan.org/

Timos and I came up with the idea and built it in PHP.

Please email me or message me on IRC if you would like your lojban feed
adding (see http://jbotcan.org/feeds for the list). Ideally it will have as
many Lojbanic feeds we can get. I'm gonna grab the feeds of those lojban
blogs floating around which I know exist.

Not sure how slow it loads, because it's quite a big page. Might have to
limit the number of items per feed.

Cheers,

Chris

P.S. source is here and I can add you to the project contributors if you
want to hack on it: http://github.com/chrisdone/hub/tree/master

